From: dresden196 <50474030+dresden196@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] NickelOS: the Welcome Tour's Bazaar step while Bazaar is being installed

On a new device the Welcome Tour starts at the first sign-in, while
Bazaar is still being installed (nickel-flatpak-defaults downloads it
from Flathub after setup). The tour's Bazaar step (Chrome 0071) waits
for a help bubble on Bazaar in the launcher, which wasn't there: the
tour stood still on its dimmed, gray screen, with no bubble and nothing
to press, until it gave up after 15 seconds.

The step is now conditional: with Bazaar in the launcher, the bubble is
on Bazaar, as before; otherwise it is on the launcher's search box and
says Bazaar is being installed and shows up in Launcher in a few
minutes. The welcome dialog also counts the tour's steps right: eight
since the Android apps step (Chrome 0073), not seven.

diff --git a/ash/ash_strings.grd b/ash/ash_strings.grd
index dcaf830..f17fbd1 100644
--- a/ash/ash_strings.grd
+++ b/ash/ash_strings.grd
@@ -7603,7 +7603,7 @@ To shut down the device, press and hold the power button on the device again.
         No thanks
       </message>
       <message name="IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_DIALOG_DESCRIPTION_TEXT" desc="Text shown in the body of the dialog as part of the System UI Welcome Tour.">
-        Take a quick tour of your <ph name="PRODUCT_NAME">$1<ex>NickelOS device</ex></ph>: where your apps are, how to get more, and the Linux underneath. 7 steps.
+        Take a quick tour of your <ph name="PRODUCT_NAME">$1<ex>NickelOS device</ex></ph>: where your apps are, how to get more, and the Linux underneath. 8 steps.
       </message>
       <message name="IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_DIALOG_TITLE_TEXT" desc="Text shown as the Welcome Tour dialog title.">
         Hi there. Welcome to your <ph name="PRODUCT_NAME">$1<ex>NickelOS device</ex></ph>.
@@ -7632,6 +7632,12 @@ To shut down the device, press and hold the power button on the device again.
       <message name="IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT" desc="NickelOS: text shown in the body of a help bubble anchored to Bazaar, the app store, as part of the Welcome Tour.">
         Get more apps in Bazaar: Linux apps from Flathub, installed as Flatpaks. They show up in Launcher like any other app.
       </message>
+      <message name="IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_INSTALLING_BUBBLE_ACCNAME" desc="NickelOS: the accessible name of a help bubble on the launcher's search box, as part of the Welcome Tour, while Bazaar, the app store, is still being installed on a new device.">
+        Tour step <ph name="STEP">$1<ex>5</ex></ph> of <ph name="TOTAL_STEPS">$2<ex>8</ex></ph>. Bazaar, the app store, is being installed and shows up in Launcher in a few minutes. Get more apps there: Linux apps from Flathub, installed as Flatpaks. They show up in Launcher like any other app.
+      </message>
+      <message name="IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_INSTALLING_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT" desc="NickelOS: text shown in a help bubble on the launcher's search box, as part of the Welcome Tour, while Bazaar, the app store, is still being installed on a new device.">
+        Bazaar, the app store, is being installed and shows up in Launcher in a few minutes. Get more apps there: Linux apps from Flathub, installed as Flatpaks. They show up in Launcher like any other app.
+      </message>
       <message name="IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_ANDROID_BUBBLE_ACCNAME" desc="NickelOS: the accessible name of a help bubble anchored to Waydroid, which runs Android apps, as part of the Welcome Tour.">
         Tour step <ph name="STEP">$1<ex>1</ex></ph> of <ph name="TOTAL_STEPS">$2<ex>8</ex></ph>. Waydroid runs Android apps, each in a window of its own. Set it up in Settings, under Apps, then Android apps. After that, opening an APK file installs the app, and Android’s apps show up in Launcher.
       </message>
diff --git a/ash/user_education/welcome_tour/welcome_tour_controller.cc b/ash/user_education/welcome_tour/welcome_tour_controller.cc
index 9f3c2d4..a7e56c7 100644
--- a/ash/user_education/welcome_tour/welcome_tour_controller.cc
+++ b/ash/user_education/welcome_tour/welcome_tour_controller.cc
@@ -409,31 +409,50 @@ WelcomeTourController::GetTutorialDescription() const {
 
     // NickelOS: Bazaar, where Linux apps come from. (Its help bubble id and
     // metrics step are the Explore app's, which NickelOS has no step for.)
+    // On a new device Bazaar is still being installed at the first sign-in
+    // (nickel-flatpak-defaults), and a bubble anchored to an app that isn't
+    // in the launcher never shows: the tour stood still on its dimmed screen
+    // until it gave up. Then the bubble is on the search box and says Bazaar
+    // is on its way.
+    const std::string bazaar_step = base::NumberToString(current_step++);
+    auto bazaar_bubble = [&](ui::ElementIdentifier anchor,
+                             user_education::HelpBubbleArrow arrow,
+                             int accessible_name_id, int body_text_id) {
+      return user_education::TutorialDescription::Steps(
+          user_education::TutorialDescription::BubbleStep(anchor)
+              .SetBubbleArrow(arrow)
+              .SetBubbleBodyText(
+                  IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_OVERRIDDEN_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT)
+              .SetExtendedProperties(CreateHelpBubbleExtendedProperties(
+                  HelpBubbleId::kWelcomeTourExploreApp,
+                  /*accessible_name=*/
+                  l10n_util::GetStringFUTF8(accessible_name_id,
+                                            base::UTF8ToUTF16(bazaar_step),
+                                            kTotalSteps),
+                  /*body_text=*/
+                  l10n_util::GetStringUTF8(body_text_id)))
+              .AddCustomNextButton(DefaultNextButtonCallback().Then(
+                  base::BindRepeating(
+                      &WelcomeTourController::SetCurrentStep,
+                      weak_ptr_factory_.GetMutableWeakPtr(),
+                      welcome_tour_metrics::Step::kExploreAppWindow)))
+              .InSameContext(),
+          user_education::TutorialDescription::EventStep(
+              user_education::kHelpBubbleNextButtonClickedEvent, anchor)
+              .InSameContext());
+    };
     tutorial_description.steps.emplace_back(
-        user_education::TutorialDescription::BubbleStep(
-            kNickelBazaarAppElementId)
-            .SetBubbleArrow(user_education::HelpBubbleArrow::kBottomLeft)
-            .SetBubbleBodyText(IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_OVERRIDDEN_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT)
-            .SetExtendedProperties(CreateHelpBubbleExtendedProperties(
-                HelpBubbleId::kWelcomeTourExploreApp,
-                /*accessible_name=*/
-                l10n_util::GetStringFUTF8(
-                    IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_BUBBLE_ACCNAME,
-                    base::NumberToString16(current_step++), kTotalSteps),
-                /*body_text=*/
-                l10n_util::GetStringUTF8(
-                    IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT)))
-            .AddCustomNextButton(DefaultNextButtonCallback().Then(
-                base::BindRepeating(
-                    &WelcomeTourController::SetCurrentStep,
-                    weak_ptr_factory_.GetMutableWeakPtr(),
-                    welcome_tour_metrics::Step::kExploreAppWindow)))
-            .InSameContext());
-
-    tutorial_description.steps.emplace_back(
-        user_education::TutorialDescription::EventStep(
-            user_education::kHelpBubbleNextButtonClickedEvent,
-            kNickelBazaarAppElementId)
+        user_education::TutorialDescription::If(kNickelBazaarAppElementId)
+            .Then(bazaar_bubble(
+                kNickelBazaarAppElementId,
+                user_education::HelpBubbleArrow::kBottomLeft,
+                IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_BUBBLE_ACCNAME,
+                IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT))
+            .Else(bazaar_bubble(
+                kSearchBoxViewElementId,
+                user_education::HelpBubbleArrow::kTopCenter,
+                IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_INSTALLING_BUBBLE_ACCNAME,
+                IDS_ASH_WELCOME_TOUR_NICKEL_BAZAAR_INSTALLING_BUBBLE_BODY_TEXT))
             .InSameContext());
 
     // NickelOS: Waydroid, for Android apps (set up in Settings > Apps, Chrome
